I'm using a ubuntu system, and my ID is felix.

Sys.setenv(LD_LIBRARY_PATH=paste(Sys.getenv('LD_LIBRARY_PATH'),'/home/felix',sep=':'))
inla.setOption(pardiso.license='/home/felix/pardiso.lic')
readLines(inla.getOption('pardiso.license'))

it returns the proper license code, but inla.pardiso.check() always gives

[1] "FAILURE: PARDISO IS NOT INSTALLED OR NOT WORKING"

